<title>AUSTRIA: Radex unit gets big South African order.</title>
<headline>Radex unit gets big South African order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veitsch-Radex, a manufacturer of fireproof materials belonging to Radex-Heraklith, said on Friday it had received a South African order worth over 700 million schillings.</p>
<p>The contract, with a duration of three years, covers the complete delivery of fireproof materials needed for a new Saldanha Steel steelworks, Veitsch-Radex said in a statement.</p>
<p>The steelworks has an annual production capacity of 1.25 million tonnes of liquid steel. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
